{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">TVB《自然系女子旅行3》由元老級主持林映暉（暉哥）聯同梁超怡（Joey）、葉靖儀（Michelle）及黃瀅仴（Verena）三位新人，帶領觀眾遊歷濟州、花蓮及台東。在第8集中，暉哥與超怡繼續帶大家玩盡濟州，發掘當地的打卡熱點與特色體驗。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>1. 濟州必去打卡聖地：翰林公園</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">暉哥和超怡首先來到佔地 33 萬平方米、設有九個不同主題區域的「翰林公園」。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">翰林公園</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">入場費：韓圜₩15,000 / 港幣約＄78</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：300 Hallim-ro, Jeju-si</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f33a4113-d2d9-4df5-a70d-aa6b4f29be11.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026tLhuwV4A691784627127.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f33a4113-d2d9-4df5-a70d-aa6b4f29be11.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9777f322-c79f-470c-b4eb-f6f6f7c89579.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026uhO8UsnFfg1784627132.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9777f322-c79f-470c-b4eb-f6f6f7c89579.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>2. 絕美海景人生四格</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">在挾才海外浴場徒步約6分鐘，便能到達一間以絕美海景為背景的「人生四格」拍攝館。遊客可在此設計一連串動作，透過簡約四格照片與朋友留下回憶，拍照後更可選擇 QR Code 下載拍攝時的影片。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">보롬사진관 협재점</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">價錢（一式兩份）：韓圜₩5,000 / 港幣約＄26</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：26 Hyeopjae 1-gil, Hallim-eup, Jeju-si</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2b000009-d070-4fe7-88f8-4f3fa25f8727.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026WQgJ3Kykzk1784627152.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2b000009-d070-4fe7-88f8-4f3fa25f8727.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>3. 新昌風車海岸道路與巨大風車</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">因濟州島風力強勁，新昌風車海岸道路的海岸線設有許多巨大的風力發電風車，形成獨特風景。該處亦擁有濟州典型的火山地貌，隨處可見由氣體釋放形成的洞穴狀「玄武岩」。玄武岩能吸收光線，使海水在光線折射下呈現綠、藍、深藍的漸變色彩，景致非常壯麗。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">新昌風車海岸道路</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：1322-1 Sinchang-ri, Jeju-si</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"75a5189c-4c2e-4e84-af42-1d41675a2c24.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20265k8Om7mbSz1784627171.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"75a5189c-4c2e-4e84-af42-1d41675a2c24.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>4. 火山岩上咖啡店與極具儀式感「落火祭」</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">行程最後來到一間建於火山岩上的咖啡店，顧客可一邊欣賞火山景觀，一邊參與極具儀式感的「落火祭」活動。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">餐飲與活動價錢：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：63-12 Jangwon-gil, Hallim-eup, Jeju-si</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9d9d6d90-ca93-47fb-b967-700cb4d58106.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026IxR6ba54z21784627185.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9d9d6d90-ca93-47fb-b967-700cb4d58106.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-21T13:54:42.798859+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":712,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}